# Product invariants (do not regress)

- **Production chrome:** sticky ATF + theme toggle only. Appearance drawer is **only** on `/playground` (`showAppearance={true}` there; false/default everywhere else including `/`, `/projects`, `/resume`).
- **Theme:** user `localStorage` / explicit preference **wins** over persona `forceDark`. Emit dual light/dark CSS tokens; `[data-theme]` remaps must work on Swiss home.
- **Impact chips (home):** Build → Scale → Defend — `€87M surfaced` / `850 negotiators` / `$1.05M/yr protected` (why-it-matters framing).
- **Projects public list:** `status === "Live"` only until Chirag re-adds in-progress.
- **LinkedIn:** `https://www.linkedin.com/in/chiraggandhi09` (never `chirag-gandhi`).
- **Copy:** read `VOICE.md` before writing site text.

Examples:

- ✅ Home ships without Appearance button; playground keeps it.
- ❌ “Build green” with Appearance on home or dark mode that ignores user toggle.
- ❌ Shipping placeholder LinkedIn or in-progress projects on `/projects`.
